   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The payment of 185k is for the Palestine Red Crescent. These funds will be used to support the needs of vulnerable people in Palestine. Having spoken to the Palestine Red Crescent Society (PRCS) to understand their current strategic objectives and priority needs, BRC will be channelling these funds directly to the PRCS to enable them to meet the urgent needs they have identified, by;
1. To continue its emergency response operations and health services delivery in West bank &amp; Jerusalem, to meet the major needs of the population.
Procuring 2 out of 15 ambulances during the project period, raising its readiness to provide emergency services.
2. &#xa0;To contribute to the inclusion of children and youth with hearing disabilities in the WB
Provision of equipment and furniture to the Total Communication Centre (hardware component).</narrative>
   </description>
