   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dear all,
Please see attached the GAD for the RCCE study and supporting documentation. Please note as this is a Movement Contribution it is a one-off payment, where all risks and responsibilities are transferred to the Grant Recipient; IFRC Geneva; BRC has no contractual responsibilities of any kind. We, the BRC has no support or monitoring role of any kind - neither programmatic nor financial. These funds are unearmarked and will be used for communication activities as part of the study. We will receive only informal updates from the partner via email which will be kept on file under the RCCE folder in the Movement Contributions Folder.
Claire, Rachel has signed the GAD, please could you authorise the payment.
Apologies this is a day delayed; the partner has only just emailed me the signed GAD.
Many thanks,
Amy</narrative>
